{
  "name": "Basilik Telegram - Sub: Create reservation",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "workflowInputs",
        "workflowInputs": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "table_id",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "name": "date",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "name": "time",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "name": "party_size",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "name": "guest_name",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "name": "language",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "b30000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "When Executed by Agent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [-820, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "row",
        "operation": "get",
        "dataTableId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "key_value",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "matchType": "allConditions",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "key",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "portal_api_base_url"
            }
          ]
        },
        "returnAll": false,
        "limit": 1
      },
      "id": "b30000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Get Portal API URL",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.dataTable",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [-600, 0],
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "notes": "Читает value из Data Table key_value по key = portal_api_base_url."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b30000-0000-4000-8000-000000000100",
              "name": "portal_api_base_url",
              "value": "={{ typeof $json.value === 'string' ? $json.value.replace(/\\/+$/, '') : '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b30000-0000-4000-8000-000000000103",
              "name": "table_id",
              "value": "={{ $('When Executed by Agent').first().json.table_id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b30000-0000-4000-8000-000000000104",
              "name": "date",
              "value": "={{ $('When Executed by Agent').first().json.date }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b30000-0000-4000-8000-000000000105",
              "name": "time",
              "value": "={{ $('When Executed by Agent').first().json.time }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b30000-0000-4000-8000-000000000106",
              "name": "party_size",
              "value": "={{ $('When Executed by Agent').first().json.party_size }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "b30000-0000-4000-8000-000000000101",
              "name": "language",
              "value": "={{ ['de','ru','en'].includes($('When Executed by Agent').first().json.language) ? $('When Executed by Agent').first().json.language : 'de' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b30000-0000-4000-8000-000000000102",
              "name": "guest_name",
              "value": "={{ ($('When Executed by Agent').first().json.guest_name || '').trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b30000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-380, 0],
      "notes": "Нормализует URL из Data Table и восстанавливает параметры входа. Ресторан портал берёт из PORTAL_RESTAURANT_SLUG."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $json.portal_api_base_url + '/api/integrations/n8n/reservations' }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ table_id: $json.table_id, date: $json.date, time: $json.time, party_size: $json.party_size, guest_name: $json.guest_name, language: $json.language }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "id": "b30000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Create Reservation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [-160, 0],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "notes": "Выберите HTTP Header Auth credential: Authorization = Bearer <PORTAL_N8N_API_KEY>. Бизнес-логика остаётся в RPC за API."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Portal API уже вернул типизированный tool envelope. Здесь только fallback\n// для сетевой ошибки HTTP Request, которую n8n пропустил в regular output.\nconst result = $input.first().json;\nif (result?.ok === true || (result?.ok === false && typeof result.error === 'string')) {\n  return [{ json: result }];\n}\nreturn [{ json: { ok: false, error: 'unreachable' } }];"
      },
      "id": "b30000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Format Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [60, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Создание брони через Portal API\n\n**Вход:** `table_id`, `date`, `time`, `party_size`, `guest_name`, `language`.\n\n1. `Get Portal API URL` читает `value` из Data Table `key_value` по ключу `portal_api_base_url`.\n2. `Config` объединяет URL с нормализованными параметрами входа.\n3. `Create Reservation` вызывает `POST /api/integrations/n8n/reservations`.\n4. `Format Response` возвращает tool envelope агенту.\n\nBearer-секрет хранится только в HTTP Header Auth credential.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 580,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "b30000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-840, -480]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "When Executed by Agent": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Get Portal API URL",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Get Portal API URL": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Config",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Config": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Create Reservation",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Create Reservation": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Format Response",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveDataSuccessExecution": "none",
    "saveDataErrorExecution": "none",
    "saveManualExecutions": false
  },
  "pinData": {},
